ent-OreBagOfHolding = 礦石收納袋 | ore bag of holding
    .desc = 一款堅固的收納袋，無論是打撈億萬富翁還是富裕的礦工，都能用來攜帶大量礦石。當繫在腰帶上時，會使附近的礦石磁化。 | A robust bag of holding for salvage billionaires and rich miners alike to carry large amounts of ore. Magnetises any nearby ores when attached to a belt.
ent-BorgOreBagOfHolding = 整合型礦石收納袋 | integrated ore bag of holding
    .desc = 一個嵌入富礦型採礦賽博格框架中的超大礦石袋。持有時會將附近的所有礦石磁化。 | A very large ore bag built into the frame of a rich mining cyborg. Magnetises any nearby ores when held.
